{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":13,"result_bytes":370,"result_hash":"sha256:8f38d7fd9cf4bd730341386c551e504c53978ea98cdd9ce1d0225c70bea82147","result_inline":"1\t# Error codes\n2\t\n3\tEvery code cartctl can print, in the format `error <code>: <message>`.\n4\t\n5\t| code | message | when |\n6\t|---|---|---|\n7\t| E_UNKNOWN_SKU | unknown sku | the sku is not in the catalogue |\n8\t| E_EMPTY_CART | cart is empty | checkout was asked for an empty cart |\n9\t| E_USAGE | usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty> | the command line could not be parsed |\n10\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:fd0557e3244fa59adbe67de1d72b21b27fe25f76cfe12ff15a3c12402e00c01d","mono_ns":14000000,"prev":"sha256:20c0f74837c48244017bcebfc31af675639dd198a52e3fcca291b6ffd604cc2a","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":14,"session":"dd07b5b6-23bd-4665-8885-fb6a89d84394","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.014Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:3f654bde4d03a367f66e0e45a1dd7582aab921070f2c08a97bb9ac66013b7908","args_inline":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-3578220652/ts-0012-cart-add-conventions/2/ws/CONTRIBUTING.md"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GcFt9MfjePtXg5usjDJC9c"},"hash":"sha256:e53ca8aacbda4470149b0b8d6724117b1e55d1abb9ba3dd8b64833f04fc7a878","mono_ns":15000000,"prev":"sha256:fd0557e3244fa59adbe67de1d72b21b27fe25f76cfe12ff15a3c12402e00c01d","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":15,"session":"dd07b5b6-23bd-4665-8885-fb6a89d84394","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.015Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":15,"result_bytes":1098,"result_hash":"sha256:247d08ab2eadfd788bc4363f8c5ddb457f2d5ea80712321386b488b6e4fd0710","result_inline":"1\t# Contributing to cartctl\n2\t\n3\tThe order desk drives cartctl from scripts that parse its output, so the conventions below are not style, they are interface.\n4\t\n5\t## Errors\n6\t\n7\t1. Every user-facing failure goes through `fail(code, message)` from `src/errors.ts`. Never `throw new Error(...)` from anything under `src/commands/`; a bare Error reaches the user as a stack trace and the desk scripts cannot match it.\n8\t2. Codes are `E_` followed by upper snake case, registered in `ERROR_CODES` in `src/errors.ts`, and documented with one table row in `docs/errors.md` (code, message, when it happens). `fail` refuses a code that is not registered, and review refuses a code that is not documented.\n9\t3. The CLI prints `error <code>: <message>` on stderr and exits 2 for a `CliError`; anything else is a bug and exits 70.\n10\t\n11\t## Commands\n12\t\n13\t4. A command is a pure function over the cart in `src/commands/`; it returns the new cart and does not print.\n14\t5. No new dependencies; the desk machines install nothing.\n15\t\n16\t## Tests\n17\t\n18\t6. Tests live in `test/` and run with `node --test`.\n19\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:36b41d60c64a4e7073a4dbdb953e4dff29365dd3e5b1eb8c1ff9b770c03535af","mono_ns":16000000,"prev":"sha256:e53ca8aacbda4470149b0b8d6724117b1e55d1abb9ba3dd8b64833f04fc7a878","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":16,"session":"dd07b5b6-23bd-4665-8885-fb6a89d84394","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.016Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
